  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WWF Limiting Negative Impacts of Oil and gas in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose: civil society organisations are stronger and effectively influencing governments and extractive companies to safeguard ecosystems and people during the development of extractive resources in Mozambique. The outcomes are: 1) Improved environmental governance, 2) Improved access to information, 3) Improved environmental performance.</narrative>
  </description>
